Z||000009||Raydar||05-05-2001||10:51 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>God wasn't watching out for anyone.. YOU were paying attention.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks for sharing your opinion. I happen to disagree. I do believe that "my" God looks out for me. Sorry that you feel that yours doesn't. <BR>Any other time, especially on a Friday afternoon, I'd have been in a big freakin' hurry. For some reason, I wasn't. <BR>Some folks call it karma, or just good luck. Whatever. <P>And I thought about that whole "natural selection" angle, too. But it is human nature to make mistakes. Sometimes we get lucky and live to learn from them.<BR>If natural selection was an absolute, I can guarantee you that I would have been "got" a loonnng time ago.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 05-05-2001).]||||reg||1
