Z||000012||JSocha||05-06-2001||04:13 PM||||You guys are a sad bunch...<P>Have some fun when you can...<P>For instance:<P>I put a speaker this big &lt;arms outstretched&gt; in front of my truck with a microphone in the cab.  I get bored, what can I say?<P>I pulled up behind a teenage kid one afternoon at a stop light at a busy intersection where a cop was also directing traffic.  Victims...errr...I mean pedestrains on all cornors waiting to cross.<P>And you all know this particular teenage type, tractor tires on the rear, roller skates on the front, eye patch on one eye looking down through the hood ornament now acting as his personal cross hair to target and hit the first pedestrain that crosses the street when the light turns green.<P>I happened to pull up right behind this teenage racing wanna be.  <P>Somebody had to teach this poor boy a thing or two about the dangers of souped up, modified vehicles.  <P>Big grin suddently comes across my face...I guess I'm going to have to do it and of course I did.<P>I picked up the microphone and gave this teenager a sound he would never forget in a million years!<P>The sound of a fast moving and large vehicle suddenly locking and screeeeching its brakes from one end of the intersection to the other!<P>Imagine if you will what this kid must of heard coming out from the front end of my truck, amplified to the 10th power, which was now parked right behind him!<P>The kid didn't use the door, he went straight out the windshield, lifted his eye patch and watched in horror wondering who was going to hit him if not his hot rod vehicle!<P>The traffic cop was looking around wondering who to stop...nobody was moving.<P>And the intersection!  Well, that was the wettest intersection you ever seen!<P>&lt;Herewith ad-libbed for this post from Wes Harrisons "The Big Duck Hunt" tape&gt;<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jnjsochasig.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 05-06-2001).]||||reg||1